y checks.","fr":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing comprehensive Django project verification and security checks.","de":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing comprehensive Django project verification and security checks.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de verificação e checagem de segurança abrangentes de projetos Django.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходима комплексная проверка и безопасность проектов Django.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق الشامل وإجراء فحوصات أمان لمشاريع Django."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure Django application quality and security by running migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks, utilizing protocols like Git for pre-deploy and PR verification.","zh":"通过运行迁移、linting、测试覆盖、安全扫描和部署就绪检查，利用诸如Git的协议进行预部署和PR验证，赋予代理确保Django应用程序质量和安全性的能力。","ja":"マイグレーションの実行、linting、テストカバレッジ、セキュリティスキャン、デプロイの準備状況の確認を行い、Gitなどのプロトコルを使用して事前デプロイとPRの検証を行うことで、エージェントがDjangoアプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保する能力を提供します。","ko":"마이그레이션 실행, linting, 테스트 커버리지, 보안 스캔 및 배포 준비 상태 확인을 실행하고 Git 等의 프로토콜을 사용하여 사전 배포 및 PR 확인을 통해 에이전트가 Django 애플리케이션의 품질 및 보안을 보장하는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to ensure Django application quality and security by running migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks, utilizing protocols like Git for pre-deploy and PR verification.","fr":"Empowers agents to ensure Django application quality and security by running migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks, utilizing protocols like Git for pre-deploy and PR verification.","de":"Empowers agents to ensure Django application quality and security by running migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks, utilizing protocols like Git for pre-deploy and PR verification.","pt":"Permite que os agentes garantam